Check the 9 host-only apps

Run the same query with the last line replaced:

| filter source == "claims-host"
| fields apmid
| sort apmid asc


If you add the host names, it's easier to tell what each app is:

fetch dt.entity.host
| fields id, name = entity.name, tags
| expand tag = tags
| fieldsAdd lt = lower(tag)
| summarize claimVals = countDistinctExact(if(contains(lt, "portfolio:claims"), tag)),
            otherVals = countDistinctExact(if(contains(lt, "portfolio:") and not(contains(lt, "portfolio:claims")), tag)),
            apmids    = collectDistinct(if(contains(tag, "APMID:"), splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1])),
            appNames  = collectDistinct(if(startsWith(tag, "APPName:"), splitString(tag, "APPName:")[1])),
            by:{id, name}
| filter claimVals > 0 and otherVals == 0
| expand apmid = apmids
| filter isNotNull(apmid)
| summarize hosts = count(), hostNames = collectDistinct(name), appNames = collectDistinct(appNames), by:{apmid}
| sort apmid asc


